<h1>Impossible Pictures</h1>
<p class="standfirst">Every picture here was made by a machine. None of them shows a real place, a real person or a real event, and none is evidence of anything. A second machine decided what each should show, and why; its idea is printed under the picture.</p>

<div class="gallery">
{%- for a in art | reverse %}
  <figure>
    <a href="{{ a.post_url | url }}"><img src="{{ ('/art/' + a.file) | url }}" alt="{{ a.alt }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ a.width }}" height="{{ a.height }}"></a>
    <figcaption><a href="{{ a.post_url | url }}">{{ a.title }}</a>. {{ a.concept }} <span class="eyebrow">Made by a machine ({{ a.model }}), {{ a.date }}</span></figcaption>
  </figure>
{%- else %}
  <p class="eyebrow">Nothing hung yet.</p>
{%- endfor %}
</div>
